            <semantic:documentation>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demand planning&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the process of forecasting future customer demand to optimize inventory management. It's a strategic approach that allows warehouse managers and demand planners to anticipate sales trends, plan for seasonal fluctuations, and ensure that the right products are available at the right time&lt;/p&gt;</semantic:documentation>
